radi znatno bolje, brže dostiže optimalnu temperaturu, samim tim i smanjuje utrošak električne energije. U velikom servisu se čisti i turbina unutrašnje jedinice koja je pokretač uređaja, dok u sklopu malog servisa to nije obuhvaćeno. Pozovite nas ili popunite kontakt formu u nastavku.\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__button-wrapper elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item \">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-cta__button elementor-button elementor-size-\" href=\"tel:0631220827\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPozovite: 063 122 08 27\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7d21f40\" data-id=\"7d21f40\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7126535 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7126535\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Kontakt forma</p>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3670ca7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-button-align-stretch elementor-widget elementor-widget-form\" data-id=\"3670ca7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;button_width&quot;:&quot;33&quot;,&quot;step_next_label&quot;:&quot;\\u0421\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434\\u0435\\u045b\\u0438&quot;,&quot;step_previous_label&quot;:&quot;\\u041f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0442\\u0445\\u043e\\u0434\\u043d\\u0430&quot;,&quot;step_type&quot;:&quot;number_text&quot;,&quot;step_icon_shape&quot;:&quot;circle&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"form