zes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://centarklimauredjaja.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/bedz.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3697 lazyload\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://centarklimauredjaja.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/bedz.png 500w, https://centarklimauredjaja.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/bedz-300x300.png 300w, https://centarklimauredjaja.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/bedz-150x150.png 150w, https://centarklimauredjaja.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/bedz-250x250.png 250w, https://centarklimauredjaja.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/bedz-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></noscript>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-dc72444 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"dc72444\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-00e4631\" data-id=\"00e4631\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e036bd9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e036bd9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">VELIKI SERVIS KLIMA UREĐAJA</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80bb4a6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"80bb4a6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Veliki servis započinjemo proverom rada klima uređaja i ispravnosti unutrašnje i spoljašnje jedinice. Nakon toga, pažljivo se skidaju filteri i plastike unutrašnje jedinice, a postavlja se zaštitni džak kako bi prostor ostao čist tokom rada.</p><p>Sledeći korak uključuje mašinsko čišćenje unutrašnjeg dela klima uređaja kompresorom, uz dezinfekciju saća unutrašnje jedinice, što osigurava eliminisanje bakterija i drugih nečistoća. Kompresorom skidamo svu prljavštinu sa turbine koja je nepristupačna i ne čisti se prilikom redovnog malog servisa, a jedan je od glavnih faktora za dugotrajan i ispravan rad klime. Takođe, serviseri detaljno čiste i dezinfikuju filtere i plastike pre nego što ih vrate na mesto. </p><p>Na kraju, proverava se ispravnost instalacije, rad spoljašnje jedinice, kao i nivo gasa u sistemu. Ukoliko je spoljašnja jedinica dostupna, vrši se i njeno čišćenje. Proces se završava pražnjenjem vode i svega onoga što se nalazi u njoj.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4366b5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"4366b5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;youtube_url&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=6Cq3u88T9Bs&quot;,&quot;lazy_load&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;video_type&quot;:&quot;youtube&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"video.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-wrapper elementor-open-inline\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-video\"></div>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9222199 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-s